e\" hreflang=\"en\" href=\"https://info.propertylist.es/general-information/greening-san-pedro-alcantara-a-new-wave-of-trees/\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"es\" href=\"https://info.propertylist.es/es/informacion-general/reverdecer-san-pedro-alcantara-una-nueva-ola-de-arboles/\">\n<link rel=\"icon\" type=\"image/png\" href=\"/wp-content/uploads/fbrfg/favicon-48x48.png\" sizes=\"48x48\">\n<link rel=\"icon\" type=\"image/svg+xml\" href=\"/wp-content/uploads/fbrfg/favicon.svg\">\n<link rel=\"shortcut icon\" href=\"/wp-content/uploads/fbrfg/favicon.ico\">\n<link rel=\"apple-touch-icon\" sizes=\"180x180\" href=\"/wp-content/uploads/fbrfg/apple-touch-icon.png\">\n<meta name=\"apple-mobile-web-app-title\" content=\"PropertyList\">\n<link rel=\"manifest\" href=\"/wp-content/uploads/fbrfg/site.webmanifest\">\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t<link rel=\"pingback\" href=\"https://info.propertylist.es/xmlrpc.php\"><meta name=\"generator\" content=\"Elementor 3.27.3; features: e_font_icon_svg, additional_custom_breakpoints; settings: css_print_method-external, google_font-enabled, font_display-swap\">\n<link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"//code.tidio.co\">\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<meta name=\"generator\" content=\"WP Super Duper v1.2.17\" data-sd-source=\"userswp\"><meta name=\"generator\" content=\"WP Font Awesome Settings v1.1.7\" data-ac-source=\"userswp\">    \n\n    \n\n\t\n\t\t<!-- Google Tag Manager (noscript) -->\n<noscript></noscript>\n<!-- End Google Tag Manager (noscript) -->\n\t\t\n        \n\n\n\n        <div class=\"body_wrapper \">\n            <div class=\"click_capture\"></div>\n\n            <div class=\"side_menu  menu_purple\"><div class=\"mobile_nav_wrapper\"><nav class=\"mobile_nav_bottom\"><h1><span style=\"font-size: 28px; font-weight: 700; text-transform: uppercase; color: rgb(11, 18, 32);\">Greening San Pedro Alcántara: A New Wave of Trees</span></h1></nav></div></div><section class=\"tip_banner_area\"><div class=\"container\"><div class=\"row\"><div class=\"col-lg-9 m-auto\">                    <div class=\"single_post_author d-flex justify-content-center\">\n        <div class=\"text post_tag\">\n                            <a href=\"https://info.propertylist.es/2024/10/01/\" class=\"meta-item date\">\n                    <ion-icon name=\"calendar-outline\"></ion-icon>\n                    October 1, 2024                </a>\n                                <div class=\"meta-item read-time\" title=\"3 minutes to read this post\"><br></div></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class=\"blog_area tip_doc_area\" id=\"sticky_doc2\"><div class=\"container\"><div class=\"row\"><div class=\"col-lg-8 blog_single_info\"><div class=\"main-post \"><div class=\"blog_single_item editor-content\"><div data-elementor-type=\"wp-post\" data-elementor-id=\"12292\" class=\"elementor elementor-12292\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-1807f8d e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"1807f8d\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-66bb6e7 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"66bb6e7\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"markdown markdown-main-panel response-optimization\" dir=\"ltr\"><p data-sourcepos=\"3:1-3:286\"><strong>The Costa del Sol town of San Pedro Alcántara is embarking on a significant reforestation project.</strong> With plans to plant 120 new trees throughout the town, the initiative aims to enhance the local environment, improve air quality, and create a more visually appealing urban landscape.</p><p data-sourcepos=\"5:1-5:275\"><strong>Deputy Mayor Javier García emphasized the importance of diversity in the tree species selection.</strong> By carefully considering the suitability of each species to its specific location, the town aims to ensure the long-term health and sustainability of the newly planted trees.</p><p data-sourcepos=\"7:1-7:331\"><strong>The reforestation project involves a two-pronged approach.</strong> Firstly, diseased or dangerous trees will be removed to make way for the new plantings. Secondly, the 120 new trees will be strategically placed throughout San Pedro Alcántara’s neighborhoods and streets, taking into account factors such as aesthetics and suitability.</p><p data-sourcepos=\"9:1-9:324\"><strong>García highlighted the numerous benefits that trees bring to a community.</strong> Trees help to improve air quality, reduce noise pollution, and provide shade during hot summer months. They also contribute to a more pleasant and inviting urban environment, enhancing the overall quality of life for residents and visitors alike.</p><p data-sourcepos=\"9:1-9:324\"><img decoding=\"async\" data-src=\"https://www.chipionanoticias.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/241001-Jardines-300x300.jpg\" alt=\"La Delegación de Parques y Jardines inicia la replantación de marras arbóreas en la localidad con una inversión de 65.250 euros – Chipiona Noticias\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAAAAACH5BAEKAAEALAAAAAABAAEAAAICTAEAOw==\" class=\"lazyload\" style=\"--smush-placeholder-width: 300px; --smush-placeholder-aspect-ratio: 300/300;\" loading=\"lazy\"></p><p data-sourcepos=\"11:1-11:402\"><strong>To ensure the success of the reforestation project, a thorough viability study is conducted for each planting location.</strong> This involves assessing the environmental conditions, soil quality, and other factors that may influence the trees’ growth and survival. By selecting the most suitable species for each site, the town aims to maximize the chances of successful establishment and long-term health.</p><p data-sourcepos=\"13:1-13:380\"><strong>The initial phase of the project has already begun, with approximately thirty trees being planted in several areas of San Pedro Alcántara.</strong> These include Calles San Javier and Vega del Mar, as well as the landscaped area at the entrance to the Al-Ándalus school. The species planted in these locations include Celtius australis, Cercis siliquastrum, and Cupressus sempervirens.</p><p data-sourcepos=\"15:1-15:331\"><strong>The reforestation efforts will continue in various other neighborhoods and streets throughout the town, including Avenidas Oriental, Marqués del Duero, del Mediterráneo, Príncipe de Asturias, Luis Braille, Pablo Ruiz Picasso, la Constitución, the boulevard, Plazas Santa Gema and de la Iglesia, El Arquillo park, and many more.</strong></p><p data-sourcepos=\"17:1-17:332\"><strong>San Pedro Alcántara’s reforestation project <span class=\"citation-0\">is a testament to the town’s commitment to environmental sustainability and enhancing the quality of life for its residents.</span></strong> By carefully selecting and planting diverse tree species, the town is creating a greener and more vibrant urban landscape for generations to come.</p></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></section><footer class=\"simple_footer\"><div class=\"container custom_container\"><div class=\"row align-items-center\"><div class=\"col-sm-6 text-right\"><ul class=\"list-unstyled f_social_icon\">\n        \n        \n                        </ul>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</footer>\n</div> <!-- Body Wrapper -->\n\n    <a id=\"back-to-top\" title=\"Back to Top\" class=\"right\"></a>\n        <div id=\"reading-progress\"><div id=\"reading-progress-fill\"></div></div>\n    <template id=\"tp-language\" data-tp-language=\"en_GB\"></template><div class=\"trp_model_container\" id=\"trp_ald_modal_container\" style=\"display: none\" data-no-dynamic-translation=\"\" data-no-translation=\"\">\n        <div class=\"trp_ald_modal\" id=\"trp_ald_modal_popup\">\n            <div id=\"trp_ald_popup_text\"></div>\n\n        <div class=\"trp_ald_select_and_button\">\n            <div class=\"trp_ald_ls_container\">\n    